{"id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-orthogonal.md","title":"正交","display":"df-orthogonal — 正交","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-orthogonal","aliases":["56-df-orthogonal"],"display":"df-orthogonal — 正交","depends_on":["[[56-df-left-linear]]","[[56-df-overlap]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_section":"§4.1 Definition 4.1.1","source_printed_pages":"88","source_ocr_blocks":[109],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-orthogonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-orthogonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orthogonal — 正交"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" href=\"?note=7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" title=\"56-df-left-linear\">56-df-left-linear</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.1 Definition 4.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"88"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>109</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftLinear}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftLinear}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" href=\"?note=7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" title=\"56-df-left-linear\">56-df-left-linear</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Overlap}\">\\(\\mathrm{Overlap}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in R\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Overlap}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in R\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Overlap}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书“左线性且无重叠”的定义；同一规则的根自重叠已在Overlap内排除。等价的“左线性且没有临界对”可由MGU存在和CP构造推出。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-left-linear","status":"resolved","id":"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-left-linear]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-overlap","status":"resolved","id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-overlap]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-left-linear","status":"resolved","id":"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftLinear}$ 见 [[56-df-left-linear]]，$\\mathrm{Overlap}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-overlap","status":"resolved","id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftLinear}$ 见 [[56-df-left-linear]]，$\\mathrm{Overlap}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftLinear}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Overlap}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in R\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Overlap}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1).","display":true}],"bytes":1349,"backlinks":[{"id":"c16c3dd943e2288c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，子项见 [[56-df-subterm]]。"},{"id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R$，满足 $\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，正交性见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；一步关系 $\\to_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。"},{"id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；$t,u\\in T$，正规形见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。"},{"id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]] 的接口，假设 [[56-df-orthogonal]] 的 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$。单步残余及新建红项的各式局部取 $a=(s,(q,L,H),t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$；单个红项残余另取 $u=(p,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$，集合残余另取 $U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$。不交谓词 $\\operatorname{Disj}(U)$ 独立以 $s\\in T$、$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 为局部参数。$\\cdot,\\preceq,\\prec,\\perp$、子项截取采用 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]；$W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}$。"},{"id":"bd57a306fd3547e4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 的定义见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。"},{"id":"f87aa675097602ab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"45d1eaa29871277d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}$ 与 $\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-normal-order]]，最外关系见 [[56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation]]；$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]，$\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}$ 与函数迭代见 [[56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy]]。"},{"id":"b1e458e60c7225cd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b,c,d,F,G,H$ 是两两不同的函数符号，前四者为常元，$F,G$ 元数2，$H$ 元数1。$V$ 可数无限且与符号集不交，$x,y\\in V$ 不同；$\\Sigma$ 由这些符号与元数确定。$\\epsilon$ 为根位置，$(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)$ 表示位置序列。红项、具体步、残余与Created见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]；类型和不交性见 [[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]，$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。"},{"id":"cdd1f74aa0c940f7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。"},{"id":"034ceadbaaf08241","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。"},{"id":"b4594163bf46851f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal.md]]"},{"id":"94c9aea947b97724","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]] 的左线性系统。$\\operatorname{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]，$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 同源；$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$；$\\operatorname{wit}$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]，$\\approx$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的相应系统实例。$s\\in T,Y\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)$，$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(s)$。"},{"id":"087a1cdc8995ba56","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。"},{"id":"b90aafd738db3274","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正交性和合流见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]、[[56-df-confluent]]；平行移动及平行关系见 [[56-lem-parallel-moves]]、[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。"},{"id":"ecff451f7a97dd8d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7fe49a97f5aa4b2b","8d38c305aa30cc4d","a6c29a8d098ef0ed"]}